Notebook[{

Cell[CellGroupData[{
Cell["Vector RT0 volume PEEC", "Title",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"20fdd968-6c5e-064c-9f34-e6e28ef2c9ad"],

Cell["\:7f2a\:96e8\:8f69 / Miao Yuxuan \[CenterDot] \:6dee\:5357\:5e08\:8303\
\:5b66\:9662 / Huainan Normal University", "Subtitle",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"05098aff-4a63-ba40-9ae3-f86df73831c3"],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Model, inputs and scope", "Section",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"12348d17-f9e3-9047-80bd-487f7c93fc11"],

Cell["(R+j\[Omega]L)i+e=C\:1d40v; Ci=b", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"4fb885fb-77f4-8940-83b4-5da7b7bf59bc"],

Cell["SI; exp(+j omega t); RMS; sigma=58 MS/m; mu_r=1; 20 C", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"41f6ab68-12d8-e048-8413-0e9482f3a734"],

Cell["\<\
Choose field or transport excitation. The field case has 1 mT RMS imposed Bz \
and zero net transport.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"44387fa4-94c9-8448-8858-86537d93e219"]
}, Open  ]],

Cell[CellGroupData[{

Cell["Derivation and interpretation", "Section",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"20dee5f5-fc7c-794e-91fe-81da090566fb"],

Cell["\<\
Lowest-order Raviart\[Dash]Thomas face-flux degrees of freedom represent a \
vector current field with cellwise divergence. Adjacent cells share oriented \
face fluxes; the incidence matrix C enforces discrete current continuity.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"e586f3da-2ed0-e049-9259-4ea94c87ed57"],

Cell["\<\
The mixed PEEC system is (R+j\[Omega]L)i+e=C\:1d40v with Ci=b. In the \
imposed-field tutorial Bz=1 mT RMS and net transport is zero; calculate \
dissipated power from the reconstructed current and resistive quadratic form.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"c7685cfa-3b52-7c46-9910-f0d93bf7ead9"],

Cell["\<\
Check the true linear residual, continuity, quadrature and spatial \
sensitivity. Imposed-field loss is a diagnostic observable; dividing it by a \
separate transport current squared would not define intrinsic conductor \
resistance.\
\>", "Text",
 Evaluatable->False,ExpressionUUID->"b2f85c99-3fe0-4645-8e76-bf1e9f2bfb2f"],

